window.products.push({"id":1114106,"name":"Parateck® 1L Professional Aluminum Whipped Cream Dispenser Gourmet Whipper Stainless Steel Decorating Nozzles + 3 pcs Plastic Pastry Tube (1L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714HetG3koL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cream whipper is a general family kitchenware and easy to use. It helpful in your daily life. You can use it to make many soft sweet desserts, for example, make the sweet and sour mousses by this cream whipper. And it is good for whipping the cream, egg honey cheese, sweet mousses, etc. Lightweight and Durable The Whipped Cream Dispenser has an all-aluminum body and head, which makes the whipped cream siphone durable, and last for a long time using. In the meanwhile, the dispenser is also very easy to clean. 2 Sets of Decorating Nozzles 3 of the durable stainless steel nozzles, and 3 of plastic nozzles. You can choose each you like. the various nozzles topping whipped cream in difference design, for whatever design you are trying to create, your desserts and food toppings will looks as great as they taste. With our whipped cream maker, your homemade treats will sure to impress friends and families, make meal and dessert time much more memorable. Compatible with All Brands of Cream Chargers This whipped cream canister work with any brand standard cartridges, including Mosa, ICO, Best Whip, isi and more (cartridges not included). Note: 1. Before using the cream whipper,gently washed the dispenser in soapy water, let it air dry, then placed it in the refrigerator so it would be chilled when you need it (do not put it in the freezer). 2. Do not put the water-fast substance into the whipper, for example the nuts, fruit, etc. 3. Cream chargers not included in the package. Q&A 1. Can I use this to make a whipped topping with coconut milk? Answer: Yes, before you whip the coconut milk, please refrigerate the coconut milk in refrigerator about 8 hours.  2. Can I open this to add sweetener after dispensing NO2? Answer: No, once the Cartridge is released into the Canister, you'd better not add anything.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714HetG3koL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parateck","source_asin":"B01KF8G956","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KF8G956","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KF8G956","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
