window.products.push({"id":1114111,"name":"gohantee St. Croix Pellet Stove Igniter Replacement for The Hastings, York Insert, and All St. Croix Pellet Stove Models Part 80P52677-R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51atx0pq8GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features: Brand New and Never used Parts.Made by Premium Quality Material.Extremely Durable Aftermarket Part.Easy to install and prefect replacement for original parts. Specifications: Watts: 250Length: 4.5\"Width: 3/8\"Connectors: Male SpadesReplaces part numbers: 80P52677-R, 80P52677-R-AMP. Compatible with Pellet Stoves & Inserts: St. Croix Pellet Stoves & InsertsPepinHastings York InsertLincoln SCRAshby MFPrescottPrescott EXPLancasterAfton BayElementAshby-P iGreenfieldAuburn Troubleshooting Igniters: Igniter failure can be verified on one of three ways.1. start your stove and visually look for the orange glow;2. physically feel around in the burn pot after the stove has been on for a few minutes to “feel” for heat being generated.3. Use a DMM (Digital Multi-Meter). Gain access to the igniter and remove it from the stove or insert. With the igniter removed from the stove, you will need to look over the part to find the rated watts.If your Ohms reading is within 10%, more or less than the rating (46Ω +/-10%), it's good. If the igniter has a \"contained short or a short\" within itself and not grounding out, your Ohms reading will be very low...usually in the single digits. Generally, you cannot have a faulty igniter with too high of a resistance reading unless an igniter is installed that is way out of spec. It's usually good to look at the part itself for the watts rating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51atx0pq8GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gohantee","source_asin":"B082HQFBTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082HQFBTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082HQFBTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
