window.products.push({"id":1114207,"name":"Beam Model 35 Mobile Maid/On-Board Bags And Filter B69041 (Pack of 3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iRdmATIwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These Beam Premium Filtration Bags are made of a multi-layer construction that allows air to flow through the bag ensuring full suction without tearing the bag. The Beam 110041/ B69041 central vacuum bags last 50% longer than regular paper bags.If you don't see your model then give us a call today at 1.800.322.2965! Our experts are more than happy to help assist you.In order to properly take care of your Beam central vacuum, it is best to change the bags when they are no more than half full. This will do 2 things to protect your investment: (1) It will allow your vacuum to give a little more power and (2) it will prolong the life of your central vacuum. Furthermore, you will notice that your vacuum motor won't perform as well when your bags are full. This is because the lining of the bag gets clogged when the bag is full. Remember: To keep your vacuum at its full potential, change your bag the second you see a decrease in your vacuum's power, as soon as you notice any odor, or simply when the bag is full. Protect your investment with the Feather Lite Carpet Deodorizer and the Tornado Power Maintenace Cloths, the ultimate way to reduce odors and restore your system to peak efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iRdmATIwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beam","source_asin":"B09GWDLFCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GWDLFCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GWDLFCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114208,"name":"Frame USA Farmhouse Series 8x10 Barnwood Picture Frames (Charcoal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911t9ODr4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of real wood, the Frame USA Farmhouse Barnwood Picture Frame adds a rustic, down-to-earth vibe to any room in the house. Inspired by the look and feel of reclaimed barnwood, these versatile, pastoral frames add fun variety to existing picture frames and seamlessly complement any traditional or contemporary décor. The 8x10 frame comes complete with real glass and has flat molding inspired by DIY frames that measures 2-inches wide and 3/4-inch deep. Included easel backing allows for easy placement on a table or shelf. For over 35 years, Frame USA has created ready-made and custom photo and art frames to customers across the United States. Each picture frame is proudly American-made in our warehouse in Cincinnati, Ohio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911t9ODr4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frame USA","source_asin":"B00VAOS68S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VAOS68S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VAOS68S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114209,"name":"Heating Element / Heater Bulb for EdenPURE, SunTwin, iHeater, EcoGREEN, and other infrared heaters.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G4Rx4ibkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND NEW AND UPGRADED Heating Element or Heater Bulb for various models of infrared heaters. These are compatible with the following models: 1000 1000 XL GEN 3 1000 and more!!! This 20,000 Hour GEN 3 Upgraded OEM Bulb is compatible with older models and will last at least 4 times longer than the older versions. You may need 6 (six) heating elements for your heater. There are five at about 6\" long and one at about 8\" long (you would probably find out exactly what I mean when you open up your heater to check - almost all infrared heaters in the market have five 6\" and one 8\" heating elements in them). They all include the ceramic ends. FREQUENT ASKED QUESTIONS: Q: WHY DO YOU NEED TO PURCHASE THESE BULBS? A: IT'S LIKE HAVING SPARE LIGHTBULBS AT HOME. YOU CAN ALWAYS EXCHANGE ONE WHEN IT'S BURNED OUT. IF YOU DON'T REPLACE THE BULB(S), YOUR HEATER WILL NOT BE ABLE TO REACH THE DESIRE TEMPERATURE. Q: HOW MANY OF THESE BULBS DO I NEED? A: EACH OF THESE TYPES OF HEATERS HAVE 6 BULBS INSIDE IN GENERAL. USUALLY IT'S ONE LONG (8\" FROM HEAD-TO-HEAD) AND FIVE SHORT (6\" FROM HEAD-TO-HEAD) BULBS. THE BULBS LISTED HERE ARE FOR 6\" AS EACH HEATER HAS FIVE OF THEM AND YOU WILL NEED THEM MORE THAN THE 8\" BULB. SOME PEOPLE HAVE TWO OR MORE OF THESE HEATERS AND IT'S A MUST TO HAVE THOSE BULBS HANDY Q: IS IT EASY TO EXCHANGE THEM? A: IF YOU KNOW HOW TO USE A SCREWDRIVER, THEN YOU SHOULD HAVE NO PROBLEM TO EXCHANGE THOSE BULBS AT ALL. I AM ALWAYS HERE TO ANSWER ALL YOUR QUESTIONS WHENEVER YOU HAVE ONE. I HAVE BEEN REPAIRING 10+ OF THESE TYPES OF HEATERS DAILY AND I DO HAVE OTHER PARTS AVAILABLE UPON REQUEST. ALL OF THEM ARE OEM AND NEW. JUST REMEMBER THAT PARTS DO GET BURNED AT SOME POINT ESPECIALLY THAT THEY ARE INSIDE OF A HEATER WITH A HIGH TEMPERATURE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G4Rx4ibkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eden","source_asin":"B005RG64LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005RG64LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005RG64LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
