window.products.push({"id":1114233,"name":"David's Home 100% Cotton Duvet Cover Set King Size, Yarn-Dyed Jacquard 3PCS Bedding Set, Soft and Breathable Comforter Cover Set, 90''x 92'', Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cF-53TgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3PCS DUVET COVER SET QUEEN SIZE: 1 piece of David's Home 100% cotton paisley damask duvet cover queen size (90 x 92 inches) with 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 inches). No Filling/ Insert. Silky Softness: The high-density cotton woven process gives this duvet cover set a remarkably silky touch. With the fabric being dyed in advance, this yarn-dyed duvet cover can be more pigmented, hardly fading after every washing. It's definitely a perfect selection for you if you want a cozy duvet cover that is available for all year. IDEAL HOME DECORATION: David's Home pure cotton duvet cover set features an exquisite paisley damask pattern on stunning shades of grey. It is decorative in nature to match or contrast with the color scheme of your bedroom. This comfy yarn-dyed duvet cover updates your room by bringing it a vintage and luxurious look. Dress up your rooms with our refined duvet cover! All Seasons Available: Lightweight but cozy enough, David's Home 100% washed cotton striped duvet cover set is suitable for all year round. It can be use on its own as a cover in spring as well as summer; and can also provide you with warmth together with your duvet insert during autumn or winter. EASY CARE: This duvet cover set is machine washable but should be washed in cold water and gentle cycle separately. Filling/rip/wrinkles won't occur after washing so plz rest assured. Tumble dry low and remove it promptly to avoid wrinkles. Do not bleach. Plz iron it at the lowest setting if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cF-53TgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"David's Home","source_asin":"B08LFW8BSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LFW8BSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LFW8BSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
