window.products.push({"id":1114276,"name":"Full Size 100% Waterproof Mattress Pad, 3D Air Fiber Fabric Mattress Protector, Easy to Clean Soft Breathable Smooth Mattress Cover, Fits Up to 21\" In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DlG+OXk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF MATTRESS PAD: Our full bed pad has a premium waterproof TPU layer to protect your mattress from urine, sweat, and all other liquid accidents. The TPU backing is noiseless, you will not hear any crinkling or plastic sounds when you sleep on it. EASY TO CLEAN MATTRESS COVER: The waterproof mattress protector applies stain-release technology. This technology ensures stains can be washed off easier and quicker when leaky messes are on the cover. Effectively save your washing time and make your mattress and our protector more durable. 3D AIR FIBER: 3D puffy fiber filling is softer and more breathable than ordinary fabric, which is highly absorbent. The top surface of our mattress pad has great breathability to disperse the heat and sweat caused by the human body. Safe and Sound promises to provide a dry and fresh sleep environment all night for you. SUPERIOR DEEP POCKET DESIGN: Full bed pad measures 54''x75''. Fits up to 21 inches in depth, suitable for most types of mattresses. The top and sides of the mattress pad are fully protected, ensuring the cover is fixed all night. No more anxiety of slipping and sliding. MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine washable and dryer friendly. Wash with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low to extend product service life. Do not iron, do not bleach. Easy install and take off to wash. It can be used in homes, hotels, hospitals, dorms, etc. We offer a 90-day full refund with no questions asked and 24-hour customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DlG+OXk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safe and Sound","source_asin":"B08213349C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08213349C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08213349C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
