window.products.push({"id":1114350,"name":"The Knit Stitch Pattern Handbook: an of 300 Designer Stitches and Techniques","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-pAFcakL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Beloved knitwear designer Melissa Leapman offers a comprehensive stitch dictionary and guide with more than 300 original knitting patterns, including slip stitches, cables, and lace. Knitters love their stitch dictionaries. Melissa Leapman, known for her knitting references, shares 300 of her favorite stitch patterns developed over her long career. With basic step-by-step knitting instruction, information on how to most effectively use a stitch dictionary, and a wealth of original stitch patterns, this book will appeal to all levels of knitters looking for a comprehensive, yet portable volume. The book includes stitch patterns in five categories from imaginative novelty stitch patterns to traditional knit designs. Each stitch pattern includes a gorgeous photograph as well as written and charted instructions. About the Author MELISSA LEAPMAN is a widely published knitwear designer whose patterns have appeared in every premier needlework publication in the country. Her knitting, crochet, and design workshops are popular with crafters at all skill levels. She has been a featured guest on DIY's Knitty Gritty , Lifetime TV's Handmade by Design , and HGTV's Sew Much More . Melissa is the author of thirteen knitting and crochet books, including Knitting the Perfect Fit , Stashbuster Knits , Mastering Color Knitting , Cables Untangled , and more. She lives in New York City.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-pAFcakL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Random House","source_asin":"B00MXDGGMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MXDGGMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MXDGGMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
