window.products.push({"id":1114428,"name":"NOVICA Floral Wood Wall Mounted Mirror, Natural Or White 'Jembrana Frangipani'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ez7Rm18TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Frangipani flowers and leaves surround a round mirror. The detailed engravings that make up the frame are hand-carved from natural suar wood and given a white antiqued finish. Sarwaedi of Bali presents this beautifully crafted wall mirror as a charming addition to a hall or entryway. - Features an aged antique finish - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly - Wood grain and color can vary slightly About our Artist: Sarwaedi recalls, 'I was born in Sukawati, Gianyar in Bali on April 21 1970. In the town where I grew up, most people are wood carvers, and so was my family. I learned wood sculpture by watching my parents. In those days, children began learning the art at a young age and I was not alone. Today, I continue working with wood, but I'm focusing on making vases and classic boxes. I give unique finishes to my designs to distinguish them from the others.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ez7Rm18TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01M1NPQYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1NPQYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1NPQYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114429,"name":"Meat Thermometers for Cooking, Grill Thermometer for Outside Grill, BBQ Thermometer with 2 Probes, Large Colorful Backlite Screen, 328ft Remote Monito","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qjP6IwLfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍖【Large Colorful LCD Backlight】 - The transmitter of our meat thermometer uses the newest technology of colorful wide view providing vision wider. When you cooking other food, just a glimpse that you can see the temperature. Beep and flash to tip that the meat is reaching your desired and perfect temp. 🍖【328FT Wireless Remote & Hands free Monitor】- Wireless digital oven thermometer can monitor food and grill temperature to a max distance of 328 ft. Using the grill thermometer can monitor your cooking temperature without having to stay in the kitchen or yard, grilling thermometer gives you the freedom to mow the lawn while waiting for cooking your dinner 🍖【Fast Read 2-5s with Dual Probes (Support 4 Probes)】- The meat thermometer with dual high precision sensor & food grade probes can instantly read the food temperature within 2-5s, with an accuracy of ±1.8℉, with a temperature range of -22℉-572℉. Choose Vermon food thermometer helps you to eliminate all the guesswork and cook perfectly every time. 🍖【Preset Temperature Settings】 - As well as offering different cooking temperatures for 8 different types of meat. This food cooking thermometer is also programmed with five approved ‘doneness’ levels that make it easy for you to cook your meat to these preferences, and all of the preset temps can be reset to suit your taste. 🍖【Timer & Alarm】- This grill thermometer features a count-down/up timer & alarms, can be active while also monitoring meat temperature, when time is up or temperature is reached, it will beep to alert you. They also have a back-lit LCD & magnet back & incorporated stand, so providing ease of use in the dark and can be attached metal surface or set at the desk or hang in the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qjP6IwLfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vermon","source_asin":"B08YN5H4MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YN5H4MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YN5H4MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114430,"name":"Booque Valley Throw Pillow Covers, Pack of 2 Soft Polylinen Woven Texture Farmhouse Plaid Cushion Covers, Hand Made Check Throw Pillow Cases for Couch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EAS89pV5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us Booque Valley is a professional pillow factory in China. Booque Valley aims to build a healthy, comfortable, warm lifestyle and is concentrated on providing fashion, beautiful, elegant and creative pillows. We are dedicated in designing different styles of decorative pillows which can be easily matched to your home decorations. Features 1. The pillow covers are made of high quality polyester material and is very durable, environmentally friendly and very comfortable.2. This pillow cover size is 18\"×18\"(45.72cm×45.72cm), can be used for 18\"x18\"or 20\"×20\" inserts.3. This cushion cover has an invisible zipper which improves the appearance and provides easy insertion and removal. 4. The pattern is same front and back, you can use it easily.5. Both indoors (living room, office, bedroom, etc.) and outdoors (patio, car, etc.) use.6. Great gift idea for friends and family. Warm Tips 1. All cushions are hand cut and made, so please understand there may be 0.5\" deviation exist.2. Due to the lighting and monitors, there is slight difference between the picture and the real item. 3. We suggest use 20\"×20\" insert to fulfill the pillowcase, so that the pillow will looks more full, more beautiful.4. We suggest spot clean, but machine wash cold separately also allowed, gently cycle only, no bleach, tumble dry low, do not iron, low temperature if necessary. Mix and Match 1. Throw our cushion cover on your sofa, it is soft enough for you to lean against them comfortably while watching TV. 2. While you playing with your kid on the floor, you can use this cushion to protect your kids.3. This cushion cover can easily match with all styles of your furniture. Customer Service 100% Return Guarantee within 30 days. If any question, please feel free to contact us. We will solve your problems within 24-hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EAS89pV5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Booque Valley","source_asin":"B089516RP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089516RP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089516RP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114431,"name":"Charcuterie Board Set – Large Cheese Board and Knife Set (Bamboo Wood) – Cheese Platter Serveware – Gift for House Warming, Bridal Shower, Wedding Reg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-jPJXhXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become a Charcuterie Expert: This cheese board makes it easy for you to create a magnificent charcuterie platter with very little expertise or effort. The presentation of your charcuterie display on this gorgeous board will have you praised as being a skilled charcuterie artist by family and friends! Cheese Server: This large (13.5\" x 13\") square serving board is perfect for any event, dinner, party, wedding, holiday celebration or birthday. There is plenty of room for generous sized portions of all your favorite hor d’oeuvres, antipasto, canapes, appetizers, cheeses, crackers, breads, dips, nuts, meats and fruit. Accessories Included: Our cheeseboard contains everything you need. The two ceramic bowls are perfect for dips, nuts or olives and the concealed drawer slides out smoothly to reveal the essential utensils for your platter and then slides back in for easy storage. Put all your crackers and breads in the serving rim on top of the board. No Engravings on Top of Board: We proudly engrave our logo discretely on the bottom of each cheese board so it does not affect the appearance of your serving platter when entertaining. Ideal Gift: Perfect for any occasion (birthday, wedding gift, couple gift, engagement, bridal shower gift, housewarming gift, anniversary, Christmas, Valentines Day, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, retirement or farewell). It is also a wonderful present for anyone (including the man or woman who has everything) – gift to Mom, Dad, husband, wife, friends, family, client or customer or add to your wedding registry item as one of the wedding registry must haves! Arrives in stylish, gift packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-jPJXhXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smith & Oak","source_asin":"B07RSBH6Q7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RSBH6Q7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RSBH6Q7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114432,"name":"Mr. Coffee 4-Cup Programmable Coffee Maker, Black (DRX5-RB)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71muEA7BbNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The classic functionality of Mr. Coffee's 4-Cup Programmable Coffee Maker helps you make rich-tasting, expertly brewed coffee without stress or mess. Set it ahead of time with Delay Brew and wake up to the enticing aroma of a fresh pot. Should you need a cup before the brew cycle is finished, Grab-A-Cup Auto Pause is a lifesaver. It stops brewing so you can pour freely, and then finishes the brewing cycle after you place the carafe back in position. Whether you want a single or double serving, this no-fuss automatic coffee maker will deliver the goods, time after time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71muEA7BbNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Coffee","source_asin":"B0008JIW8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0008JIW8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0008JIW8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
