window.products.push({"id":1114567,"name":"Melange Coupe 16-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Gold Leaves) | Service for 4 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ci2h2IlvL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping.  - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F.  - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe.  - 0% porosity for greater durability.  - Complete set for service of 4 or 8.  - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ci2h2IlvL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074X5KSHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074X5KSHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074X5KSHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114568,"name":"Glass Teapot Set, OAMCEG Stovetop Glass Tea Kettle (40OZ / 1.2 L) Teabloom Teapot with 6 Double Wall Glass Teacups Blooming Loose Leaf Tea Pot Set, wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-0R7hxBfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵 Supreme Borosilicate Glass - Durable yet lightweight, crystal clear borosilicate glass feels wonderful in the hand. Constructed of the highest-quality materials that never lose their brand-new appearance, this is truly a teapot and teacup for all occasions. Optimized high grade borosilicate glass ensures the teapot and teacups possesses ultimate strength and heat resistance (able to withstand instant temperature changes in a range of -20℃-150℃) 🍹 Outstanding Design - Beautiful clear teapot body with handcrafted special design prevents dripping from the spout; prefect tightly covering lid are able to avoid the leaking problem after remove the filter; special stainless steel mesh infuser filter ensures the pure tea without loose tea. The sturdy 18/8 stainless steel infuser insert and attached lid will never rust, corrode, or discolor. 🍃 Extra 6 Double Wall Glass Cups -The tea kit set will come with 6 double wall teacups (2.7oz) which allow you to enjoy a cup of flower tea, espresso, wine, Cappuccino , Latte or Turkish coffee, juice in your hands while keeping your fingers safe without feeling the heat. You will enjoy your wonderful tea time with our glass teapot and glass mugs. 💮 Excellent Visibility Due to Its Clearness - The imported Borosilicate glass of our tea kettle is very clear and thus allows for excellent visibility when brewing teas that have blooming flowers or stylish leaves unfurling. Watch the delicate leaves dance gently when immersed in the hot water, slowly developing their unique color and telling you when it's perfectly ready for the first sip. 🌼 A Perfect Gift for All - With deep-rooted values in craftsmanship, innovation, art and beauty, we blend techniques, stories, people and ideas. Whether you need a gift for friends, newlyweds, graduates, relatives or yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-0R7hxBfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OAMCEG","source_asin":"B08YJTFZTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJTFZTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJTFZTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
