window.products.push({"id":1114668,"name":"Butane Torch, Refillable Kitchen Torch Lighter with Safety Lock & Adjustable Flame, Culinary Blow Torch Lighter for Desserts, Creme Brulee, BBQ and Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avbpVtONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【Safe and Durable】 -- The safety lock prevents accidental ignition. A broad base made of aluminum alloy material makes it more durable and sturdy helps to prevent it from falling over. Long angled nozzle and burn-free finger guard keep your hand safely away from the flame. We crafted our culinary torch out of professional-grade materials, providing you with a safe and easy-to-use tool. ★【Reusable & Easy to Operate】 -- This Butane Torch supports any butane on the market, and you can easily refill it (NOTE: butane gas is not included). You only need to open the safety lock, and you can easily ignite through a single point of pressure call out fire. Of course, due to its small size, you can easily carry it to more outdoor activities, such as camping weekends or BBQs that adults and children are looking forward to. ★【More Convenient Ignition Mode】 -- Single-point pressure ignition switch, so you can turn it on at any angle. At the same time, the flame temperature can be quickly increased from 0 to 1300 °C/2372 °F through the regulator, and the flame length can be up to 6 inches. And you can also use \"On-Lock\" to lock the flame directly, so you can keep a constant flame even after you release the switch. ★【A Gift with More Uses】 -- The torch is ideal for caramelizing sugar atop creme brulee, glazing a baked ham, searing a steak, roasting bell peppers, melting cheese, and toasting breadcrumbs. It is also useful for lighting your fireplace, candles, or cigars, for hobbies, arts and crafts projects, jewelry making, welding, for multiple camping applications, dabs, and much more. ★【Lifetime Professional Technical Support】-- We offer one of the best Butane Torch warranties in the industry, with a 90-day refund and lifetime free customer support. Buy for you without risk. For any product questions, please don't hesitate to email us. We are always ready to provide you with satisfactory solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avbpVtONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meskaitey","source_asin":"B0B2JKTMJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2JKTMJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2JKTMJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1114669,"name":"Primitives by Kathy 26945 LOL Made You Smile Dish Towel, 28-Inches Square, My Family Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j4ZkruWbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Sturdy dish towel reads: My Family Tree has some twisted freak in' roots. Made from strong, high quality cotton for softness and durability. stitching, and fabrics. What happens when a retail genius and her amazingly talented husband follow their retirement from the marine Corps with the purchase of a kitchen shop? magic happens! in the spring of 2013, Johnny designed artful, whimsical and fun LOL towels all in one night. The next day they set out to find themselves a screen printing machine, taught themselves to make it go, and have since sold thousands of these cheerful little towels from their shop in Savannah, Georgia. Partnering with Primitives by Kathy, they are thrilled to take their production to a whole new level. Welcome to the world of LOL - made you smile! in 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an Initial relationship with goodwill services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j4ZkruWbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B00VGE6Y90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VGE6Y90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VGE6Y90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
