window.products.push({"id":1114810,"name":"POEM Studio Crystal 3D Heart Photo - 3D Crystal Engraved Picture, Personalized Photo Gifts of 3D Engraved Photo Crystal - Custom Heart Crystal with Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q-GmQ+9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHERISH YOUR MEMORIES FOREVER - Every 3D heart crystal is customized with your own HD laser-etched photo and personalized engraving. A perfect keepsake for any person or pet that is dear to you. We convert your image into 3D, size it, position your 3D model & laser engrave it to create a 3d crystal photo. CUSTOM CRYSTAL PHOTO: Nothing says I love you more than this heart shaped photo 3D crystal. It is the perfect gift for your loved one or a wonderful memorial to someone who may have passed. It also is a great gift for anniversaries, Christmas, mother’s day, weddings, sympathy/memorials as well as Valentine's Day PERFECT GIFT IDEA FOR FAMILY AND FRIENDS: If you need a perfect custom gift for family and friends, then look no further! This 3D photo crystal is the perfect gift choice for Valentine's Day, Birthday's, Anniversaries, Mother's Day, event awards, graduations or any special occasion OPTIONAL LED LIGHT BASE: Nothing enhances a 3D crystal more than an LED light base. All the details in your picture come to life when illuminated by the matching light base making the 3D effect really pop! Our light bases are battery powered for a wireless display. Who wants messy cables cluttering the effect! 3 SIZES & SHIPPING: The photo 3D crystal heart is available in 3 different sizes; small, medium, and large. Full sizing and customizing information is detailed in the product description below. All Crystal orders are shipped within 0-3 business days reducing the wait time and providing more time for enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q-GmQ+9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POEM Studio","source_asin":"B09QNS1LCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QNS1LCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QNS1LCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
