window.products.push({"id":1114963,"name":"Spellbinders MMM-202 Artisan Explorer Raspberry Spacer Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JYM+D6fKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As a scrapbooking and craft enthusiast, Stacey Caron identified the market need for one die cutting system that could function in place of several existing tools. She wanted a comprehensive craft tool that would be universal with manufacturers' existing products, cut, emboss, be portable and be sturdy enough to withstand the test of time. As a result of Stacey's entrepreneurial spirit and her husband Jeff's creative ingenuity, the Wizard Universal Craft Tool was born, along with Spellbinders patented technology Die Templates for cutting, embossing and stenciling. Innovations continue with the Grand Cali bur machine and the Presto Punch machine, the first automatic punching and embossing system. Spellbinders continues to demonstrate ingenuity, integrity and trend setting ideas, while remaining a family-owned, customer service oriented business. Spellbinders Paper Arts entered the craft and hobby market in 2003 with the introduction of the Wizard Universal Craft Tool and now has more than 250 patented and patent pending products under the trade names of Nest abilities, Edge abilities, Shape abilities, Border abilities and Nestles. This Raspberry Spacer Plate is for use in the Spellbinders Media Mixage Artisan X-plorer Machine. Create a sandwich for ES (only) M-Boss abilities Folder and other embossing folders that are no wider than 4-1/2\". Start by stacking from bottom up: A Base Plate, ES M-Boss abilities Folder and the Artisan X-plorer Raspberry Spacer Plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JYM+D6fKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spellbinders","source_asin":"B00BRGAI30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1114963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BRGAI30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BRGAI30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
